      "message": "First of all, you are not removing the device when the entry is empty, which is necessary.\nSecondly, what you quoted applies to the Map interface in general, whereas mBroadcastMetadataMap is a ConcurrentHashMap. In ConcurrentHashMap, the compute method guarantees that `the entire method invocation is performed atomically.`\nhttps://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ConcurrentHashMap.html#compute(K,java.util.function.BiFunction)",
